# THE ZERO CASE: the proxy supplied no publication date. latest_date must be ABSENT rather than emitted as 0001-01-01T00:00:00Z, and latest_release_age_days must be null. This is the shape that regressed unseen, and it is why this fixture exists.
$ kanonarion latest example.com/quiet --json
exit 0
